      "finding": "Shared validation excludes booleans, negatives and non-integers before reading. Request.body counts actual streamed bytes, rejects at the first crossing before appending/caching that chunk, checks cached bounds without reading, and preserves direct ClientDisconnect. Original json and stream helpers remain intact."
