      ],
      "finding": "The middleware buffers original ASGI request messages while counting actual body bytes. First oversize crossing rejects before app invocation. Accepted messages replay with original chunk boundaries; once those messages are exhausted, receive delegates to the original channel. A disconnect captured before final body completion is replayed to the downstream app, whose Request.body raises ClientDisconnect if it consumes that stream. These choices satisfy the explicit scoped task requirements; coalescing and pre-invocation disconnect rejection are not required by the task."
